# ── Pre-commit gate ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Mirrors the CI checks that don't need Postgres/Redis so a failing commit can
# never reach origin. The full Vitest suite is intentionally NOT here — it
# needs the DB services and is slow. Run `npm test` manually before a PR.
#
# `test:catalogue` is the one Vitest file that has no service dependencies
# (filesystem only) — it catches i18n error-key drift, which previously
# slipped past lint/typecheck and broke CI.
#
# Bypass (only for true emergencies, and fix in the next commit):
#   git commit --no-verify
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

set -e
npm run lint
npm run typecheck
npm run data:lint
npm run test:catalogue
